# Cloudflare response headers (PageSpeed → Best Practices → Trust and Safety)
# The headers of every rule that matches a path are applied together: the shared ones live in /*, the specific ones
# in their own blocks.
# Stage is kept out of search by the Worker (worker/index.ts → serveAssets), not here.
# X-Robots-Tag stays for good (not a launch TODO): kulbit.site is a portfolio / Awwwards site and must never compete
# in search with the client's own site kulbit.com. robots.txt keeps crawling allowed so crawlers can read the noindex.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

# Hashed build assets never change under the same URL (Cloudflare's default is max-age=0)
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
